  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform metallic wire carries a current <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>,&nbsp;when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> battery is connected across it. The mass of uniform metallic wire is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>,&nbsp;density is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;and resistivity is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> &nbsp;The length of wire is :&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "YNGzu",
      "text": "<p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Iy6e0",
      "text": "<p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> &nbsp;</p>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8Jb17",
      "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> &nbsp;</p>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rdQYa",
      "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>From Ohm&#39;s law, resistance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>V</mi><mi>I</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p>As resistance of wire is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mi>A</mi></mfrac></math>, where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is area and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math>&nbsp;is length of wire.</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mi>A</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow><mi>&#961;</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Now, volume<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p>Thus,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow><mi>&#961;</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>l</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mtext>volume</mtext><mi>l</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow><mi>&#961;</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>l</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mi>&#961;</mi></mfrac><mfenced><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>",
